# Local scratch output for sweeps, profiler runs, and plots. Nothing here is
# checked in: the piecemeal rules this replaces interacted badly with the root
# .gitignore (which drops *.log and *.csv globally), so `git add experiments/...`
# silently committed plots while dropping the CSV they were derived from.
# Summarise results in README.md instead; the raw run output stays local.
experiments/
